    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d409">

                <pb facs="0732" n="600" xml:id="pg600"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">740.00119 EAC/7–845: Telegram</note>
                <head>No. 409<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of
                            State to the Ambassador in the United Kingdom</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                    >Winant</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">secret</hi>
                        <lb/>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">us urgent—niact</hi>
                    </seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1945-07-08T13:00:00-04:00">July 8, 1945—1
                            p.m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>5561. You are authorized to accept the Soviet proposal to omit final sentence of
                    report accompanying agreement re French zone in Germany. (Your <hi
                        rendition="#small-caps">Comeas</hi> 324<anchor n="1" xml:id="d409-f1"/> and
                        327<anchor n="2" xml:id="d409-f2"/>)</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Grew</hi>
                        
                        <lb/>
                        H[enryl P L[everich]
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
